  "confidence": 1.0,
  "rationale": "The policy requires branch manager approval for continuing the relationship with a customer or beneficial owner who becomes a PEP. RBI instructions require senior management approval, and a branch manager is an internal designation that can be part of senior management or a stricter standard, but since senior management approval is obtained, it complies with the core requirement."
